(text "Population stages are assembly instructions, not bypasses of hardware interlocks.\nTH301 electrical sensor is remotely bonded to insulated PA case via test pads; do not fit a second NTC in parallel.\nR403 zero-ohm can be removed to isolate the gate driver during dummy-load tests.\nDo not inject28V into this board.16.8V failed-buck test uses rated surrogate load with U401/Q402 absent." (at 15 255 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a967fc2e-9d0b-50ce-9ff3-cde2c6849608"))
